OL,3,AMinisters reject dog ownership licence
OL,4,Ascheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FPet owners will not have to pay a fee
OL,7,Fto own a dog, after the government
OL,8,Fruled out introducing a licensing
OL,9,Fscheme.
OL,11,FIn a report, published on Thursday, a
OL,12,Fpanel of animal experts suggested the
OL,13,Fgovernment should consider new legal
OL,14,Frequirements for dog owners.
OL,16,FThe panel did not reach an agreement on
OL,17,Fwhich rules should be adopted but the
OL,18,Ftaskforce said any new laws should aim
OL,19,Fto promote better dog control, reduce
OL,20,Fthe risk of dog attacks and avoid
OL,21,Fplacing an "undue burden" on owners.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
