OL,3,AMinisters reject dog ownership licence
OL,4,Ascheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the environment
OL,7,Fdepartment said: "This is a welcome
OL,8,Freport and ministers are considering
OL,9,Fthe taskforce's recommendations,
OL,10,Fhowever we will not be introducing a
OL,11,Fnew dog licensing scheme."
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
